    "Diffusion is soft and wide, Bloom is tighter, and Halation is a red fringe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩散柔和而宽，光晕更紧，光晕（Halation）是红色边缘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "擴散柔和而寬，光暈更緊，光暈（Halation）是紅色邊緣。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ディフュージョンは柔らかく広く、ブルームはより締まり、ハレーションは赤い縁です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dims the picture outside this color's range. It is not kept when you press OK.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压暗此颜色范围之外的画面。按“好”后不会保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壓暗此顏色範圍之外的畫面。按“好”後不會保留。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この色の範囲の外を暗くします。OK を押しても残りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
