    "HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出每种颜色。颜色编辑一个色族。点颜色调整你选取的颜色。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出每種顏色。顏色編輯一個色族。點顏色調整你選取的顏色。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
