        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平の定規"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与已选颜色可以相差多远仍会被选中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顏色與已選顏色可以相差多遠仍會被選中"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "採取した色からどれだけ離れても選択されるか"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕线条之间的距离"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "螢幕線條之間的距離"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スクリーンの線の間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个颜色通道（0–255）与单击颜色可以相差多少仍会被选中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個顏色通道（0–255）與單擊顏色可以相差多少仍會被選中"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各カラーチャンネル（0–255）がクリックした色からどれだけ違っても選択されるか"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化从每条边缘延伸多远，以像素为单位。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "銳化從每條邊緣延伸多遠，以像素為單位。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シャープが各エッジからどこまで届くか。単位はピクセル。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在亮度上覆盖多远。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整在亮度上覆蓋多遠。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整が明るさのどこまで届くか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在色相上覆盖多远。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整在色相上覆蓋多遠。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整が色相のどこまで届くか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在饱和度上覆盖多远。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整在飽和度上覆蓋多遠。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整が彩度のどこまで届くか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的距离，以像素为单位"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的距離，以像素為單位"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ぼかしが届く距離。単位はピクセル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差有多少扩散到相邻像素。较小会得到更平坦的区域"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個像素的誤差有多少擴散到相鄰像素。較小會得到更平坦的區域"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各ピクセルの誤差が隣へどれだけ広がるか。少ないほど平坦な領域になります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用多少配置文件的扭曲校正。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用多少配置檔案的扭曲校正。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロファイルの歪み補正をどの程度適用するか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用多少配置文件的晕影校正。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用多少配置檔案的暈影校正。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
